    "reason": "[ev-689bc0108c6c] says only that `tls.caOptional` \"has been removed\" from ForwardAuth and several providers. It doesn't say what happens to configurations that still set it. The proposed resource-rejected consequence says the field no longer exists in the Middleware schema, but the CRD validator refuted that: the field is still in the v3.0.0 traefik.io Middleware schema [ev-0842f8f3bd9d]. So schema rejection is contradicted, and nothing shows whether the value is now ignored, rejected at runtime or still honoured. To decide the consequence, we need the v3.0.0 behaviour for configurations that still set `tls.caOptional`, for example from the code or a changelog entry.",
